    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist Now!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.poster.avif?t=1753349983\" width=604 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.webm?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.mp4?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>WARBOUND</strong> combines strategic deckbuilding with epic kingdom conquest, delivering a captivating RTS experience. Build your base, assemble your battle deck, and lead powerful armies to conquer rival kingdoms in dynamic, real-time warfare. With every decision, the fate of your kingdom rests in your hands.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3d81b37aed61a3dfbc6fd0bf14f232a4.poster.avif?t=1753349983\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3d81b37aed61a3dfbc6fd0bf14f232a4.webm?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3d81b37aed61a3dfbc6fd0bf14f232a4.mp4?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><strong>Dynamic Deck Building</strong>: Collect and craft your ultimate deck with powerful army and potion cards. Choose your cards carefully\u2014each battle is a test of your strategy and skill.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/8ae3e021083ca2c8557898c8aaadcdec.poster.avif?t=1753349983\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/8ae3e021083ca2c8557898c8aaadcdec.webm?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/8ae3e021083ca2c8557898c8aaadcdec.mp4?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Epic Kingdom Conquest</strong>: Invade rival kingdoms across varied landscapes. Strategize your approach, deploy your King, and crush your enemies in intense real-time battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/fe99c3c6589985e27120af0292a1fe9b.poster.avif?t=1753349983\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/fe99c3c6589985e27120af0292a1fe9b.webm?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/fe99c3c6589985e27120af0292a1fe9b.mp4?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Diverse Battle Cards</strong>: Unlock a wide range of army and spell cards, from swordsmen to dragons, fireballs to cyclones. Every card brings unique strengths to your deck.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3f3b8aa0ae0905cf955449dd1de3c192.poster.avif?t=1753349983\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3f3b8aa0ae0905cf955449dd1de3c192.webm?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3f3b8aa0ae0905cf955449dd1de3c192.mp4?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Real-Time Base Building</strong>: Expand your kingdom by constructing vital buildings that generate resources and offer defense. Balance your economy while preparing for relentless invasions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/9e9465e1e46fc4db218fc1a2e1ffc412.poster.avif?t=1753349983\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/9e9465e1e46fc4db218fc1a2e1ffc412.webm?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/9e9465e1e46fc4db218fc1a2e1ffc412.mp4?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>WARBOUND</strong> will keep you on your toes as you face fierce rivals and rise to supremacy. <strong>Will you lead your kingdom to glory, or will your enemies bring you to ruin?</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>WARBOUND</strong> combines strategic deckbuilding with epic kingdom conquest, delivering a captivating RTS experience. Build your base, assemble your battle deck, and lead powerful armies to conquer rival kingdoms in dynamic, real-time warfare. With every decision, the fate of your kingdom rests in your hands.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3d81b37aed61a3dfbc6fd0bf14f232a4.poster.avif?t=1753349983\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3d81b37aed61a3dfbc6fd0bf14f232a4.webm?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3d81b37aed61a3dfbc6fd0bf14f232a4.mp4?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><strong>Dynamic Deck Building</strong>: Collect and craft your ultimate deck with powerful army and potion cards. Choose your cards carefully\u2014each battle is a test of your strategy and skill.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/8ae3e021083ca2c8557898c8aaadcdec.poster.avif?t=1753349983\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/8ae3e021083ca2c8557898c8aaadcdec.webm?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/8ae3e021083ca2c8557898c8aaadcdec.mp4?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Epic Kingdom Conquest</strong>: Invade rival kingdoms across varied landscapes. Strategize your approach, deploy your King, and crush your enemies in intense real-time battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/fe99c3c6589985e27120af0292a1fe9b.poster.avif?t=1753349983\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/fe99c3c6589985e27120af0292a1fe9b.webm?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/fe99c3c6589985e27120af0292a1fe9b.mp4?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Diverse Battle Cards</strong>: Unlock a wide range of army and spell cards, from swordsmen to dragons, fireballs to cyclones. Every card brings unique strengths to your deck.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3f3b8aa0ae0905cf955449dd1de3c192.poster.avif?t=1753349983\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3f3b8aa0ae0905cf955449dd1de3c192.webm?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3f3b8aa0ae0905cf955449dd1de3c192.mp4?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Real-Time Base Building</strong>: Expand your kingdom by constructing vital buildings that generate resources and offer defense. Balance your economy while preparing for relentless invasions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/9e9465e1e46fc4db218fc1a2e1ffc412.poster.avif?t=1753349983\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/9e9465e1e46fc4db218fc1a2e1ffc412.webm?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/9e9465e1e46fc4db218fc1a2e1ffc412.mp4?t=1753349983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>WARBOUND</strong> will keep you on your toes as you face fierce rivals and rise to supremacy. <strong>Will you lead your kingdom to glory, or will your enemies bring you to ruin?</strong>",
